        "source_locator": {
          "kind": "stage-direction",
          "ordinal": 1,
          "description": "Source block 1: (உள்ளே உமா பயந்து நடுங்குதல். விங்கனும் ஜம்புவும் வெளியே பல மிருகங்களைப் போலக் கத்துதல். உமா பயந்து, எழுந்து வருகிறாள். விங்கன் ஜம்புவை மறைத"
        },
        "speaker_label": null,
        "speaker_label_origin": null,
        "source_delimiter": null,
        "page_provenance": [
          {
            "pdf_page": 44,
            "printed_page": 43
          }
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "notes": [],
        "english_text": "(Inside, Uma trembles with fear. Outside, Vingan and Jambu make the cries of several animals. Frightened, Uma gets up and comes out. Vingan hides Jambu and signals him to keep making the sounds; Jambu does so, while Vingan lies down. Uma opens the door and comes outside. Vingan pretends to be asleep; when she throws the end of her sari over him, he cries out and gets up.)"
      }
    },
