      },
      "translation": {
        "english_text": "Why should I be afraid? I am not afraid of anything!—If a tiger comes, it will tear me apart with its mouth. If an elephant comes, one stamp will finish me. If any bones are left, the wolves will eat them and go!... Why are you worrying? You go lie down and sleep!",
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "notes": []
      }
    },
    {
